 131:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sai.c ****       Below the list the others API available SAI HAL driver :
 132:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sai.c **** 
 133:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) HAL_SAI_EnableTxMuteMode(): Enable the mute in tx mode
 134:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) HAL_SAI_DisableTxMuteMode(): Disable the mute in tx mode
 135:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) HAL_SAI_EnableRxMuteMode(): Enable the mute in Rx mode
 136:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) HAL_SAI_DisableRxMuteMode(): Disable the mute in Rx mode
 137:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) HAL_SAI_FlushRxFifo(): Flush the rx fifo.
