 203:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sai.c ****     In that case first register the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 204:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sai.c ****     using HAL_SAI_RegisterCallback before calling HAL_SAI_DeInit
